    - id: 1
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Actor
        value: 4
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: I decided to write down a report of the strange disease swimming in
          the air of our home.  And to write my frustration with the nobles.  After
          all, what are they going to do? Kill me?  Better than to be eaten.
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      conversationID: 4
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 4
        originDialogueID: 1
        destinationConversationID: 4
        destinationDialogueID: 3
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 72.66667
        y: 91.33334
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 3
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Actor
        value: 4
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "It all started when one of the workers in the sweat shop dropped
          dead.  A common occurrence but one with concerning signs.  The corpse was
          filled with yellow pus, their ears leaking and their face slowly disintegrating. 
          The first victim laughed quietly\u2026 almost like he knew what was happening?
          Or at least was happy with his death."
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      conversationID: 4
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 4
        originDialogueID: 3
        destinationConversationID: 4
        destinationDialogueID: 5
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 85.33334
        y: 156
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 5
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Actor
        value: 4
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "The council of nobles knew, but when we found that it only affected
          the workers they ignored my pleas to at least fix the laborer\u2019s privy.
          After all, that would require them to spend money on their workers... I
          never thought that would bite us again."
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      conversationID: 4
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: 
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 4
        originDialogueID: 5
        destinationConversationID: 4
        destinationDialogueID: 7
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 80.000015
        y: 211.33331
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 7
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Actor
        value: 4
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: Some time passed and the bodies that were infected - I ordered that
          they be burned to stop any possible contamination.  I already knew they
          were dead... But they got up... and that's when it happened.
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      conversationID: 4
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: 
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 4
        originDialogueID: 7
        destinationConversationID: 4
        destinationDialogueID: 8
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 78.6667
        y: 290.66666
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 8
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Actor
        value: 4
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "Every worker turned into one of those things - an abomination.  Even
          the ones that were still alive were changed. They must\u2019ve been pretending
          to still be normal somehow \u2013 until they rushed and smashed all the
          guards\u2019 heads in.  They cheered and spoke, but they weren't alive
          anymore. I could tell. The guards they killed turned into strange bloated
          corpses with the parasites moving their bodies.  Me, some nobles, and a
          handful of guards have locked ourselves up in here. Praying for help...
          I hope we get it soon."
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      conversationID: 4
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: 
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 4
        originDialogueID: 8
        destinationConversationID: 4
        destinationDialogueID: 10
