      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "Madison Walker \nCrime: Drug dealing\n\nMadison tests lead to us
          discovering that the chemicals could create different effects depending
          on the person.  In this case, she grew an extra arm in her back but soon
          dissolved.  Will try out on the next criminal."
