      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: 'Adam Biccino:

          Crime: Council member who refused to resign.


          I
          always gain a unshakable smile when I see a one of those old elves that
          have been in power for centuries by this point finally get their deserved
          punishment.  This one expectionally since he always claimed criminals deserve
          a second chance. Bah.  They should just rot in hell.  They always should
          and will when I''m in charge.


          The test didn''t go as well he
          dissolved almost instantly.  Shame.'
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
