        value: The king was pleased that we finally got a first successful subject
          and have been creating more of the Runic Dwarf - super soliders.  Turning
          a defect into a useful tool!  I'm suprised the first sucessful test was
          his own son - (harsh) but I'm just glad it's not my becon.
