      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: (A few days later) We have examined more of the Restraint genetic
          in the subjects.  The annoying thing about this disease is that it's genetic
          and can't be used as bio-weapon of some sort.  Or at least not yet.  The
          tests we have done with the Super soldiers and test subjects have gone
          well enough - only losing 3 subjects instead of 20.  But the king should
          be pleased next visit.
