      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: 'My father was not pleased - when he found out.  That I couldn''t
          use magic... or at least magic just won''t work properly with me.


          I
          never understood why the Restrainted disease was so viled by dwarfs and
          humans.  With humans - my guess was because they just hate everything.
          But dwarfs... their suppose to be jolly figures right...?  '
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
