    - id: 3
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 20
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "It was my turn - I was expecting to die - to finally get this twisted
          project my father set up to be over with.  but the Owl must have a sick
          sense of humor.\n\nFirst successful test run. Woo. \n\nI'm much more protected
          they can't lose their one successful test rat.   But I fear that won't
          last long."
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      conversationID: 33
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: 
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 33
        originDialogueID: 3
        destinationConversationID: 33
        destinationDialogueID: 4
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 154.66666
        y: 168.66666
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 4
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 20
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "I saw Sabbine corpse today as they were taking me for tests today. 
          They figured out how to replicate the process and are now being more -
          experimental.  The one bit of good news is that the other dwarfs look at
          me as a leader figure - I don't know why maybe it's because I killed one
          of the doctors by luck.  \n\nHowever, I will find a way to get us all out
          of here.\n\nI must."
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      conversationID: 33
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: 
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 33
        originDialogueID: 4
        destinationConversationID: 33
        destinationDialogueID: 5
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 152
        y: 256
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 5
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 20
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: '(The memory is bloody and hard to see read but eventually it comes
          in better thanks to Callus).


          We did it -Their all dead - every
          single one of those damn doctors are dead...  The problem now is that we
          are reviled too.  Thanks yo those collars we did things that we would never
          have done.  So now the general public thing we are crazed cultists for
          my father...


          Though Crazy may be correct.  I don''t know why
          but I feel like I see things differently.  My father supposedly got killed
          by rebels but those rebels just put my sister in charge.  Supposedly she
          helped them out greatly.  Good for her - I''m glad she grew a spine.


          Wish
          it was just before I got sent here.'
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      conversationID: 33
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
