    - id: 1
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 20
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: 'I may be going insane.  I just finished talking to the goddess Orin...
          The lady of Grief/Destruction herself. (Crazy how life is).


          But
          the plan is relatively simple - We would unleash a horde of monsters onto
          the region - we will have ghost ships making sure no one can escape.  While
          the monsters run rampant.  We will give each city and town a choice - death
          - or a culling of evil - (Children will be spared and be taken to a disclosed
          location to be taught better then how current society teaches them)  Those
          that we will be culling are basically any criminals - supporters of the
          old regimes, and those that will cling on to certain policies of evil. 
          We must remove any stain of the old society so that the new society we
          are building is held down by the old.'
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      conversationID: 34
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: 
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 34
        originDialogueID: 1
        destinationConversationID: 34
        destinationDialogueID: 8
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      - originConversationID: 34
        originDialogueID: 1
        destinationConversationID: 34
        destinationDialogueID: 9
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 160
        y: 80
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 3
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 20
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: 'In this way - we can truly build a world - against hate, ableism,
          and getting true justice to the victims.  Orin when we finish will be the
          ever gentle yet iron fist on justice and crime.  While for me, I will be
          executed.  those that build the new society must be completly clean that''s
          why Orin isn''t helping - only a servent of her''s which is now my servent. 
          I will be executed and give the world to my brothers and sisters of the
          runic dwarfs as their will be the ones who aren''t directly involved. 
          Though their are some who refuse to leave me to carry this massacure by
          myself.

          (I''m honored)'
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      conversationID: 34
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: 
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 34
        originDialogueID: 3
        destinationConversationID: 34
        destinationDialogueID: 5
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 181.3751
        y: 240.673
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 4
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 20
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: 'Today''s the day - I''m going to blow up my old home, my sister,
          and countless others...  I''m probably gone mad haven''t I?  Maybe.  But
          if I could save future generations from the problems of government abuse
          then I will do it.  In order to save the world...


          Thank you,
          my diary,

          Stryker.


          (As the memories end you do see
          a small diary underneth a bed.  It''s unreadable because of age).'
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      conversationID: 34
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: 
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks: []
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 180.99063
        y: 702.2402
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 5
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 20
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "(As I was preparing for the plan to save the world - I decided to
          explore the world.  I wasn't surpised with the cruelty of the nobles and
          while my sister was trying her best.  She was still corrupt.\n\nI did however,
          explore the elven territories and the an Island near are continent.\n\nThe
          elves were very accepting of me and my message - so much so that they protected
          a bunch of dark elf refuggess that escaped to their home.  Despite the
          council protests.  Those protests died quickly but after working with them
          their new leaders a bit(We wanted to keep the people out of the way as
          to keep their purity). \n\nI'm excited to see them in the new society."
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      conversationID: 34
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: 
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
