        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 6
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 20
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: My finally stop was at the city of slaves.  Though it was heartbreaking
          to see how crushed their souls were.  Barely any money to survive - let
          alone smile and when I brought up fighting back.  they just laughed - saying
          they would rather not die and keep living... This wasn't living though
          - it was simply existing.  I sweared to myself that I would save these
          people.  No matter what.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
