      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: I also went to the island of Orc's (As I like to call it) Supposedly
          the Arden family were back to their old tricks trying to create a slave
          planatation.  I of course burned these slavers to a pulp and found the
          orc's to be some of the gentlist giants I ever met.  I agreed to come back
          once my mission was done.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
